1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,730
Just joined ChickenSMP.

2
00:00:02,833 --> 00:00:03,663
This is ChickenSMP.

3
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:07,520
Survival, but with its own economy.

4
00:00:08,633 --> 00:00:11,413
Sell your loot on the auction house,
fill orders for cash,

5
00:00:11,413 --> 00:00:13,523
and catch fish worth millions.

6
00:00:14,633 --> 00:00:17,363
Right outside spawn waits the PvP area.

7
00:00:17,813 --> 00:00:21,343
Build, fight, and your blocks
vanish after twenty minutes.

8
00:00:22,383 --> 00:00:25,653
Every hour, everyone online
gets a free crate key.

9
00:00:26,023 --> 00:00:28,693
Daily rewards and quests pay even more.

10
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:32,600
Join now at chickensmp.net.

11
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:33,720
See you in game.

